  "description": "<p data-start=\"46\" data-end=\"446\"><strong data-start=\"46\" data-end=\"67\">Mario Tennis Aces</strong> is een dynamische en competitieve <strong data-start=\"102\" data-end=\"115\">sportgame</strong> voor de Nintendo Switch waarin Mario en zijn vrienden het tegen elkaar opnemen op de tennisbaan. De game combineert klassieke tennisregels met unieke speciale slagen, snelle reflexactie en strategische diepgang. Zowel casual spelers als fanatieke gamers kunnen genieten van de verschillende spelmodi, alleen of samen met vrienden.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"448\" data-end=\"527\">De game verkeert in <strong data-start=\"468\" data-end=\"486\">In Nette Staat</strong>, is volledig getest en direct speelbaar.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"529\" data-end=\"532\">\r\n<p data-start=\"534\" data-end=\"549\">⭐ <strong data-start=\"536\" data-end=\"549\">Voordelen</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"550\" data-end=\"718\">\r\n<li data-start=\"550\" data-end=\"592\">\r\n<p data-start=\"552\" data-end=\"592\">🎾 Actieve en toegankelijke tennisgame</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"636\">\r\n<p data-start=\"595\" data-end=\"636\">🕹️ Unieke speciale slagen en strategie</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"637\" data-end=\"686\">\r\n<p data-start=\"639\" data-end=\"686\">👨‍👩‍👧‍👦 Geschikt voor solo en multiplayer</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"687\" data-end=\"718\">\r\n<p data-start=\"689\" data-end=\"718\">🎮 Bekende Mario-personages</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"720\" data-end=\"723\">\r\n<p data-start=\"725\" data-end=\"745\">📋 <strong data-start=\"728\" data-end=\"745\">Specificaties</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"746\" data-end=\"936\">\r\n<li data-start=\"746\" data-end=\"775\">\r\n<p data-start=\"748\" data-end=\"775\">Platform: Nintendo Switch</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"776\" data-end=\"804\">\r\n<p data-start=\"778\" data-end=\"804\">Titel: Mario Tennis Aces</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"805\" data-end=\"830\">\r\n<p data-start=\"807\" data-end=\"830\">Genre: Sport / Tennis</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"831\" data-end=\"872\">\r\n<p data-start=\"833\" data-end=\"872\">Spelmodus: Singleplayer & multiplayer</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"873\" data-end=\"910\">\r\n<p data-start=\"875\" data-end=\"910\">Taal: Engels (menu’s en gameplay)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"911\" data-end=\"936\">\r\n<p data-start=\"913\" data-end=\"936\">Staat: In Nette Staat</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"938\" data-end=\"941\">\r\n<p data-start=\"943\" data-end=\"961\">📦 <strong data-start=\"946\" data-end=\"961\">Meegeleverd</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"962\" data-end=\"999\">\r\n<li data-start=\"962\" data-end=\"999\">\r\n<p data-start=\"964\" data-end=\"999\">Nintendo Switch game <strong data-start=\"985\" data-end=\"999\">met doosje</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1001\" data-end=\"1004\">\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1006\" data-end=\"1067\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">🛡️ <strong data-start=\"1010\" data-end=\"1028\">Incl. Garantie</strong><br data-start=\"1028\" data-end=\"1031\">Incl. Garantie: <strong data-start=\"1047\" data-end=\"1067\" data-is-last-node=\"\">1 maand garantie</strong></p>",
